      "cooked": "<p><span>This seems like a really dumb question, but if I sell a batch of beer for $3, do I score that batch at the end? At first I assumed yes, but then I read the Game End, and it seems like no.</span><br><br><b>\"Any beer that has been brewed but not yet sold is counted in a player's final score.\"</b><br><br><span>It seems strange, because of the track, you almost have to sell beer.&nbsp;</span></p>",
